# Published with the package (package.json "files": "src/Appearance"), minus
# tests and test helpers. npm and pnpm both honor a nested .npmignore inside a
# "files" directory. A "!" pattern in "files" itself would not do: npm 11
# honors it, but pnpm 10 ignores it. ClassicyPackageExports.test.ts checks
# what both packers really pack.
*.test.*
__tests__/
